    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（中甲），非普通</em><br />穿着這套護甲期間，你可以以附贈動作讓這套護甲向四周釋放出劇毒的孢子，孢子將充滿以你爲中心的10尺半徑球狀區域。任何在這片區域內的生物都必須通過一次[[/save ability=con dc=15]]豁免，豁免失敗將陷入 <strong>中毒Poisoned</strong> 狀態，持續直至你的下一回合結束。此屬性一旦被使用，直到次日黎明前都無法被再次使用。</p><div class=\"WordSection1\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE:char;MARGIN:2pt 0cm 10pt\"><span class=\"GramE\">該護甲</span>由<span class=\"GramE\">互相鎖接的</span>金屬環組成，通常着裝於布衣或皮衣的夾層之間。這種護甲爲着裝者的上半身提供了適中的保護，<span class=\"GramE\">且鎖環間</span>相互碰撞的聲音也可以被外層衣服減弱。</p></div></div><p>While wearing this armor, you can take a bonus action to make the armor emit poisonous spores, which fill a 10-foot-radius sphere centered on yourself. Each creature in that area must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=15]] saving throw or have the poisoned condition until the end of your next turn. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p><p>Made of interlocking metal rings, a chain shirt is worn between layers of clothing or leather. This armor offers modest protection to the wearer's upper body and allows the sound of the rings rubbing against one another to be muffled by outer layers.</p></div>",
